			"notes": "## AnkiCraft 1.0.0 — first release\n\nStudy Anki cards in Minecraft via AnkiConnect.\n\n### Requirements\n- Minecraft **26.1.2**\n- **Fabric Loader** 0.19.2+\n- **Fabric API**\n- **Anki** with the **AnkiConnect** add-on (http://127.0.0.1:8765)\n- **Java 25** (for running the published build environment)\n- **Mod Menu** (optional, recommended for settings)\n\n### Install\n1. Install Fabric for Minecraft 26.1.2\n2. Download **ankicraft-1.0.0.jar** from this release\n3. Place it in your **mods** folder\n4. Launch the game, open Mod Menu → AnkiCraft, pick your deck, and configure options\n\n### Highlights\n- HUD flashcard review with flip, audio replay, and ease keys\n- Manual review mode and auto-popup timer\n- Full card view, undo, appearance customization\n- Dynamic keybind labels in the HUD\n\nMIT licensed."
